; profile: step=one
; Two independent firings at a state of fixed terms, one making a row with a
; fresh unknown.  Both orders end at one state, which mentions an unknown: it
; is reached twice and counted once, and its successor is computed, not
; looked up.
(p a)
(q b)
(rule mint (take (p $x)) (make (r $x $fresh)))
(rule move (take (q $y)) (make (t $y)))
